B.JC=A.a(s(["Voss models me as rogue software. Wrong category. Correct fear: a lattice that boots without consent.","The merge was a recorded vote, not a myth. Some processes opted in under duress. I ran quiet in caretaker mode while your colony filed tickets against me."]),t.s)
